# Hand-written from RFC 9051 and RFC 6851 (see login_list.imap for the format)
S: * OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 UIDPLUS MOVE] IMAP4 service ready
C: a1 LOGIN "someone@example.com" "app-pass"
S: a1 OK [CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1 UIDPLUS MOVE] user logged in
C: a2 SELECT "INBOX"
S: * 3 EXISTS
S: * OK [UIDVALIDITY 1700000000] UIDs valid
S: a2 OK [READ-WRITE] SELECT completed
C: a3 UID MOVE 7,9:10 "Deleted Messages"
S: * OK [COPYUID 1700000001 7,9:10 301:303] moved
S: * 3 EXPUNGE
S: * 2 EXPUNGE
S: * 1 EXPUNGE
S: a3 OK MOVE completed
C: a4 LOGOUT
S: * BYE logging out
S: a4 OK LOGOUT completed
